115392	115451	115468	115469	Sir Rupert	528	" Oh ! these are my _ Concaves _ and _ Convexes _ . All from the two to the seven are cut concave ; and all from the eight to the king are cut convex . By cutting the pack breadthways a convex card is cut ; by cutting it lengthways , a concave one is secured . "
