115563	115570	115583	115583	Chichester	527	" Is my initiation now complete ? "
115571	115581	115583	115583	Chichester	527	" There are several other schemes with the cards , "
115585	115686	115744	115745	the one	13845	" but I think that I have taught you enough for this evening . One famous device , however , must not be forgotten . You have heard of the way in which Lord de Roos lately attempted to cheat his noble companions at the club ? The plan practised by him is called _ sauter la coupe _ , and enables the dealer to do what he chooses with one particular card , which of course he has selected for this purpose . Now look how it is done ; for I can better show practically than explain verbally . "
