231263	231267	231328	231329	the landlord	1805	" Boozing - Ken "
231289	231292	231328	231329	the landlord	1805	" all sorts "
231321	231326	231328	231329	the landlord	1805	" Well , Joe , "
231350	231358	231365	231366	the man	1303	" what news down at Cow Cross ? "
231359	231363	231376	231379	a journeyman - knacker	7752	" Nothink partikler , "
231381	231467	231476	231477	the landlord	1805	" We have been precious full of work lately -- and that 's all I knows or cares about . Seventy - nine horses I see knocked down yesterday ; and out of them , fifty - three was so awful diseased and glandered when they was brought in , that we was obleeged to kill 'em and cut 'em up with masks and gloves on . It was but three weeks ago that we lost our best man , Ben Biddle:--you recollects Ben Biddle ? "
231468	231474	231476	231477	the landlord	1805	" I knowed him well , "
231479	231498	231510	231511	the knacker	7754	" He took his ' morning ' here reglar for sixteen years , and never owed a penny . "
231499	231508	231476	231477	the landlord	1805	" But do you know how he died ? "
