248060	248066	248068	248068	Richard	498	" Speak , I say ! "
248079	248142	248187	248187	his	498	" speak . You do not know -- you can not guess how necessary it is for me to have my present suspicions cleared up ! Speak -- I swear no harm shall happen to you : on the contrary -- I will reward you , if it should turn out as I suppose . Once more , who are these villains ? "
248143	248147	248068	248068	Richard	498	" They are called-- "
