248156	248160	248068	248068	Richard	498	" The Resurrection Man-- "
248161	248164	248187	248187	his	498	" Ah ! "
248165	248170	248184	248184	Markham	498	" And the Cracksman . "
248171	248182	248187	248187	his	498	" Then I am right -- my suspicions are confirmed ! "
248201	248223	248250	248250	Richard	498	" Sit down , my good lad -- sit down : you and I have not done with each other yet . "
248267	248337	248382	248382	Richard	498	" Sit down -- and fear nothing . I swear most solemnly that no harm shall happen to you , be you who or what you may : for I can not suppose that you are a participator in the crimes of these miscreants . You would not have come to me to tell me all this -- Oh ! no ; Providence has sent you hither this day . "
