248474	248486	248494	248494	Holford	784	" that they are more than body - snatchers and burglars ? "
248487	248492	248494	248494	Holford	784	" More , sir ! "
248502	248517	248528	248528	Markham	498	" Oh ! no , sir -- how can they be more than that ? "
248518	248526	248528	248528	Markham	498	" They are more -- far more , "
248534	248539	248545	248545	Holford	784	" they are murderers ! "
248540	248543	248575	248575	Markham	498	" Murderers ! "
248559	248573	248575	248575	Markham	498	" Yes -- murderers of the most diabolical and cold - blooded description , "
248577	248639	248645	248645	Holford	784	" But it is too long a tale to tell you now . Let it suffice for you to know that I was myself upon the point of becoming a victim to that most infernal of all miscreants , the Resurrection Man ; and I should conceive that the other whom you named is in all respects as bad as he ! "
248640	248643	248677	248677	Markham	498	" Murderers ! "
248672	248675	248677	248677	Markham	498	" Murderers , "
248680	248692	248699	248699	Holford	784	" and through you must they be surrendered up to justice ! "
248693	248697	248677	248677	Markham	498	" Through me ! "
248701	248736	248753	248753	Holford	784	" Yes -- through you . If you be really imbued with such honourable feelings as you ere now professed , you will not hesitate for one moment in discharging this duty towards society . "
248737	248751	248753	248753	Holford	784	" But it would be an odious act of treachery on my part , "
248755	248764	248782	248782	Markham	498	" let the men be what they may . "
248765	248780	248782	248782	Markham	498	" If you manifest such a reluctance to rid the metropolis of two murderers , "
248785	248945	248955	248955	Holford	784	" I shall conceive that you are more intimately connected with them than you choose to admit . But if you imagine that these villains are more innocent than I describe them -- if you fancy that some motive prompts me to exaggerate their infamy , I will tell you that no language can enhance their guilt -- no vengeance be too severe . Have you not heard that men have disappeared in a most strange and mysterious manner within the last year , at the eastern end of the metropolis,--disappeared without leaving a trace behind them,--men who were not in that situation which hurries the despairing wretch on to suicide ? You must have heard of this ! If not , learn the dismal fact now from my lips ! But the assassins -- the dark and secret assassins of these numerous victims , are the wretches whom we shall this night lodge in the grasp of justice ! "
248946	248953	248955	248955	Holford	784	" As you will , sir , "
248975	249000	249009	249009	Markham	498	" I was to meet them at the _ Dark - House _ at nine o'clock : do you take measures to secure them . "
249001	249007	249031	249031	Richard	498	" Most assuredly I will , "
249012	249029	249031	249031	Richard	498	" And when I think of all that you have told me , my good lad , "
249033	249051	249057	249057	Holford	784	" I am inclined to believe that you yourself would have been a victim to those wretches . "
249052	249055	248955	248955	Holford	784	" Me ! "
249067	249100	248955	248955	Holford	784	" Yes -- such is now my conviction . They made an appointment with you at the _ Dark - House _ , to give you a sum of money you say ? "
249101	249106	248955	248955	Holford	784	" Yes , sir . "
249107	249198	249213	249213	Holford	784	" Foolish boy ! Do such men pay their agents or accomplices who fail to fulfil their designs , or who deceive them ? do such men part with their money so readily -- that money which they encounter so many perils to obtain ? And that _ Dark - House_--the place of your appointment,--that _ Dark - House _ is in the immediate neighbourhood of the head - quarters of their crimes ! Yes -- there can not be a doubt : you also were to be a victim ! "
249199	249211	249293	249293	Markham	498	" My God ! what a fearful danger have I incurred ! "
249278	249291	249513	249513	Markham	498	" You say that the hour of meeting is fixed for nine ? "
249305	249492	249567	249567	Markham	498	" Yes , sir ; and now let me thank you with the most unfeigned sincerity for having thus saved me from a dreadful death . Your kindness and condescension have led to a lengthy conversation between us ; and accident has made me reveal to you those particulars which have led you to form that conclusion relative to the fate destined for myself . You must not imagine for a moment that I would league with such villains in any of their diabolical plans . No , sir -- I would sooner be led forth to the place of execution this minute . Although I consented to do their bidding in one respect , I repeat that I had mine own curiosity to gratify -- that is , my own inclinations to serve : but when they wished to make me their instrument and tool in forwarding their unholy motives , I shrank back in dismay . Oh ! yes , sir -- now I comprehend the entire infamy of those men 's characters : I see from what a fearful abyss I have escaped . "
249554	249565	249567	249567	Markham	498	" The gang may be more numerous than I imagine , "
249569	249614	249626	249626	Holford	784	" indeed , I know that there are a third man and hideous woman connected with those two assassins whom you have already named . It will therefore be advisable to lay such a trap that will lead to the capture of them all . "
249615	249624	249626	249626	Holford	784	" Oh ! by all means , sir , "
249630	249642	249659	249659	Markham	498	" I do not wish to show them any mercy now ! "
249643	249657	249659	249659	Markham	498	" We have no time to lose : it is now four o'clock , "
249661	249682	249689	249689	Holford	784	" and we must arrange the plan of proceeding with the police . You will accompany me on this enterprise . "
249683	249687	249689	249689	Holford	784	" Mr. Markham , "
249695	249788	249809	249809	he	498	" I have no objection to aid you in any shape or way in capturing these miscreants , and rooting out their head quarters ; but I must beg of you not to place me in a position where I shall be questioned how I came to make this appointment for to - night with those two wretches . It would compel me to make a revelation of the manner in which I employed my time during the last few days ; and _ that_--for certain reasons -- I could not do ! "
249795	249808	249809	249809	he	498	" I do not see how your presence can be dispensed with , "
