263786	263826	262980	262980	Greenwood	541	" Very true -- very true , my dear fellow . But do you imagine that I became a Member of Parliament to meet the interests and wishes of a pack of strangers , or to suit my own ? "
263827	263833	263739	263743	the new Member of Parliament	8231	" And at the next election---- "
