376960	377012	377421	377423	the Resurrection Man	14742	" All I want you to do is to remain quiet -- attend to my wishes -- keep a close tongue in your head -- and have no eyes for any thing that I do n't tell you to look at,--and then we shall go on as pleasant as before . Otherwise-- "
