395229	395240	395252	395255	the Buffer 's wife	10787	" Only Mr. Banks , the undertaker , Mrs. Wicks . "
395241	395250	395252	395255	the Buffer 's wife	10787	" Oh ! Mr. Banks , was it ? "
395271	395281	395193	395194	the Buffer	5278	" and a highly respectable individual he is too . "
