395376	395395	395402	395403	Mrs. Smith	631	" And so I suppose , ma'am , you 've made the arrangements with him for the funeral ? "
395396	395400	395402	395403	Mrs. Smith	631	" Just so , "
395405	395425	395586	395587	the visitor	3285	" and in the course of the day I expect a wery pious minister of Mr. Banks 's acquaintance . "
395574	395584	395586	395587	the visitor	3285	" Pardon me , ma'am , if I intrude , "
