457303	457330	457155	457156	the Rattlesnake	503	" For your sake , I give my most solemn pledge not to do aught that may injure that man on account of his past offences . "
457331	457336	457155	457156	the Rattlesnake	503	" A thousand thanks ! "
457341	457389	457395	457395	Viola	995	" Let us now proceed . But , heavens ! you have got nothing on your head nor on your shoulders ; and I did not notice that before ! Take my bonnet and shawl , madam -- I am more accustomed to the cold than you . "
