457397	457415	457467	457467	she	503	" in five minutes I shall be at my own house . Come -- let us proceed . "
457459	457466	457467	457467	she	503	" In another hour , madam , "
457470	457488	457448	457449	the Rattlesnake	503	" I shall not be in London . _ Then _ only shall I consider myself safe . "
457489	457550	457572	457572	she	12178	" At least allow me to supply you with some money for your immediate purposes . I have none about me , and I know not whether my husband has left a single shilling in the house ; but any of my tradesmen in the neighbourhood will honour my draft ; and if you will walk in for a few minutes-- "
457551	457570	457604	457604	she	995	" Thank you , madam -- thank you for your kind consideration ; but I am well supplied ; "
457598	457603	457604	457604	she	995	" At all events , "
457607	457624	457631	457632	the Rattlesnake	503	" should you ever require a friend , do not hesitate to apply to Mrs. Chichester . "
457625	457629	457631	457632	the Rattlesnake	503	" Mrs. Chichester ! "
457634	457674	457681	457681	Viola	995	" surely I have heard that name before ? Oh ! I recollect -- I have taken to the post - office letters from Tidkins to a Mr. Chichester , who , I suppose , must be your husband . "
