461386	461448	461458	461460	Mary - Anne	929	" it is now my duty to return your confidence with a reciprocal frankness . But , alas ! what I am about to say can not tend to soothe your sorrows , since -- as I fondly believe -- it will only confirm you in the impression that the affections of him whom _ you _ love are fixed elsewhere . "
