462215	462222	462224	462224	Isabella	495	" No , my dear friend , "
462231	462264	462270	462272	Mary - Anne	929	" your prospect is not so gloomy as you would depict it . There is one star that burns in the same heaven which is above us all;--and that star is Hope . "
