462276	462296	462309	462309	Isabella	495	" ah ! where does hope exist for me ? Is not hope extinguished in my heart for ever ? "
462297	462307	462309	462309	Isabella	495	" In the one sense , hope is dead , "
462313	462492	462512	462514	Mary - Anne	929	" but hope beams not only in one sphere . The attentions of your friends -- the kindness of your relations , will combine to cheer your path ; and surely this conviction must be allied to hopes of tranquillity , peace , and even happiness ! Consider , Mary - Anne -- you have a father who is still in the vigour of his years : you will live for him ! You have brothers who must soon enter upon their respective careers in the great world : you must live for them ! You have friends who are devoted to you : you will live for them also ! Oh ! do not speak of death with levity : do not seem to invite its presence ! We do not live for ourselves only : we live for others . To yield to those feelings which facilitate the ravages of sorrow and encourage the inroads of grief , is to perpetrate a slow suicide . God and man alike require that we should war against our misfortunes !
462493	462510	462512	462514	Mary - Anne	929	" Alas ! I have not that great moral courage which characterises your soul , Isabella , "
462516	462543	462571	462571	Isabella	495	" I am a weak and fragile plant , that bends to the lightest gale . How , then , can I resist the terrible tempest ? "
