492370	492573	492767	492767	he	1026	" I am not yet an outcast from divine mercy ! Heaven itself manifests an interest in my welfare : dare I neglect the warning ? No -- no ! I have sinned -- but there is repentance . Upon my otherwise spotless life there is one stain ; but tears of regret shall be shed unceasingly until the mark be washed away ! And thou , temptress -- never more must we meet as we have lately met ; I must shun thee as my evil genius ! Yet I do not blame thee -- for I myself was fond , and being fond , was weak . If I fell , and can yet aspire to pardon and forgiveness,--I who was strong,--what extenuation may not exist for thee -- a poor , weak woman ! Oh ! let the light of divine grace shine in upon my soul , even as these bright beams of the orb of day penetrate with cheering influence to my very heart ! Let me rise up from the depths of sin , stronger than when I fell,--so that sad experience may tend to confirm my resolves to pursue the paths of chastity and virtue ! "
