501938	501946	501994	501994	Margaret	964	" I have -- I have indeed ! "
501978	501992	501994	501994	Margaret	964	" I have often read and heard of the King of the Gipsies , "
501996	502029	502045	502045	Skilligalee	937	" but I always imagined that he was a fabulous character . Is that old man yonder really the King ; or has he only assumed the distinction by way of amusement ? "
